# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
# Python packages for fetch_rates.py (curl_cffi + certifi), installed with pip --user and moved here
# from /volume1/web/.local on 2026-09-24. Third-party code, ~31 MB, referenced by server.js's
# PYTHONPATH -- it lives on the NAS, not in git. Reinstall with:
#   pip install --user --target .python-packages/lib/python3.8/site-packages curl_cffi
.python-packages/

# Live server data (PII, secrets, runtime state)
